
## 2. Root `.gitignore`

Path: `GeoFlare/.gitignore`

Ye important hai, bhai. Isse virtual environment, secret keys aur bade raw datasets galti se GitHub par push nahi honge.

```gitignore
# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# Virtual environments
.venv/
venv/
env/

# Environment secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Frontend
node_modules/
frontend/dist/
frontend/.vite/

# Generated data
data/raw/*
data/interim/*
data/processed/*

# Keep folder documentation and sample datasets
!data/raw/**/README.md
!data/interim/**/README.md
!data/processed/**/README.md
!data/samples/**

# Logs and editor settings
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/